-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ד/5 — עדכון תעריף דמי שתיה לעובדי הוראה בחטיבה העליונה (23.1.2014)
-- The drinks allowance under the Etzioni agreement for upper-division
-- teachers: who it is given for, its rate from 3/2013, and the Ministry's
-- retroactive reimbursement of the owners.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Months are numbers YYYYMM.
`March 2013`     MEANS 201303
`September 2013` MEANS 201309

§ `חוזר תשע"ד/5 דמי שתיה בחטיבה העליונה`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The heading "כללי"; no rule.

@desc A teaching employee's month at a school, as the drinks allowance asks about it.
DECLARE `drinks month` HAS
    `graded as a teaching employee`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc graded in the teaching-employees grading
    `employed by a supervised owner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of education supervised by the Ministry of Education
    `in the upper division`          IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed in the upper division (only)
    `position at the school`         IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a position held at the school
    `work month of the school year`  IS A NUMBER  @desc which month of the school year's work this is (1 to 12)
    `month`                          IS A NUMBER  @desc the calendar month, YYYYMM

-- ¶14: under the Etzioni agreement teachers have an allowance for drinks
-- (coffee, tea, milk, sugar) during working hours at school. ¶15: it is
-- given for each teacher employed at the school at a third of a position or
-- more, for 10 working months of the school year.
@ref akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15
GIVEN m IS A `drinks month`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the allowance is given for the month` m IF
        m's `position at the school` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    AND m's `work month of the school year` AT LEAST 1
    AND m's `work month of the school year` AT MOST 10

-- 1: the circular applies to owners' teaching employees in the upper
-- division only.
@ref akn:art_1/p1
GIVEN m IS A `drinks month`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` m IF
        m's `graded as a teaching employee`
    AND m's `employed by a supervised owner`
    AND m's `in the upper division`

-- 2 ¶1: from 3/2013 the rate is 10.42 (printed "ש"ש"; the amount is per
-- working month, by ¶15's ten months). Before 3/2013 this circular states
-- no rate.
@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN `month` IS A NUMBER @desc YYYYMM
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the drinks rate` `month` IS
    IF `month` AT LEAST `March 2013` THEN JUST 10.42 ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN m IS A `drinks month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the drinks allowance for the month` m IS
    IF `the circular applies to` m AND `the allowance is given for the month` m
    THEN CONSIDER `the drinks rate` (m's `month`)
         WHEN JUST r  THEN r
         WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
    ELSE 0

-- 2 ¶2: accordingly the Ministry reimbursed the owners (subject 11 in the
-- payments system) in the December 2013 payments, retroactively from
-- September 2013.
@ref akn:art_2/p2
GIVEN `month` IS A NUMBER @desc YYYYMM
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Ministry reimburses the month at the new rate` `month` IF
    `month` AT LEAST `September 2013`

-- F-2013-14_tashad_05-a: the rate stands from 3/2013, the reimbursement
-- at it from 9/2013; March to June 2013 are working months at the new
-- rate that the circular reimburses at no rate.
`a month at the new rate that is not reimbursed at it` MEANS
        `the drinks rate` 201304 EQUALS JUST 10.42
    AND NOT `the Ministry reimburses the month at the new rate` 201304
#ASSERT `a month at the new rate that is not reimbursed at it`

DECLARE `drinks action` IS ONE OF
    `reimburse the owners at the new rate` HAS `reimbursed from month` IS A NUMBER

-- The reimbursement as an obligation: subject 11 (דמי שתיה) in the
-- payments system, in the December 2013 payments, retroactive from
-- September 2013. Time in months from September 2013 (December 2013 = 3).
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `drinks action`
DECIDE `the December 2013 reimbursement` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owners at the new rate` m PROVIDED m EQUALS `September 2013`
    WITHIN 3
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ד/5, section 2: reimbursement in the December 2013 payments, retroactive from September 2013"

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, the signature, the list of copies and the footer; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The teachers are made up for the purpose.
`a full-time teacher in October 2013` MEANS
    `drinks month` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `in the upper division`          IS TRUE
        `position at the school`         IS 1
        `work month of the school year`  IS 2
        `month`                          IS 201310

`a quarter-time teacher in October 2013` MEANS
    `drinks month` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `in the upper division`          IS TRUE
        `position at the school`         IS 0.25
        `work month of the school year`  IS 2
        `month`                          IS 201310

#ASSERT `the drinks allowance for the month` `a full-time teacher in October 2013` EQUALS 10.42
#ASSERT `the drinks allowance for the month` `a quarter-time teacher in October 2013` EQUALS 0

#TRACE `the December 2013 reimbursement` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `reimburse the owners at the new rate` 201309 AT 3

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over a finite space: every combination of the grade, the
-- owner and the upper division; positions in twelfths from 0 to 1.5; work
-- months 0 to 12; calendar months from 1/2013 to 12/2014.

`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`twelfths to 1.5` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 12) (range 0 18)
`months checked` MEANS
    append (map (GIVEN k YIELD 201300 PLUS k) (range 1 12)) (map (GIVEN k YIELD 201400 PLUS k) (range 1 12))

GIVEN g IS A BOOLEAN, u IS A BOOLEAN, p IS A NUMBER, w IS A NUMBER, c IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `drinks month`
DECIDE `a checked month` g u p w c IS
    `drinks month` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS g
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `in the upper division`          IS u
        `position at the school`         IS p
        `work month of the school year`  IS w
        `month`                          IS c

-- ¶15 and sections 1-2 over the whole space: the allowance is 10.42 or
-- nothing; it is 10.42 exactly for an upper-division teaching employee at a
-- third of a position or more, in one of the ten working months, from
-- 3/2013; it does not grow with the position past the threshold.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN u YIELD
                        all (GIVEN p YIELD
                                all (GIVEN w YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN c YIELD
                                                LET a MEANS `the drinks allowance for the month` (`a checked month` g u p w c)
                                                IN      (a EQUALS 0 OR a EQUALS 10.42)
                                                    AND (a EQUALS 10.42)
                                                        EQUALS (    g AND u AND p AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
                                                                AND w AT LEAST 1 AND w AT MOST 10
                                                                AND c AT LEAST `March 2013`))
                                            `months checked`)
                                    (range 0 12))
                            `twelfths to 1.5`)
                    `both booleans`)
            `both booleans`

-- Over a school year at full time from 9/2013, ten months are paid and two
-- are not.
#ASSERT count (filter (GIVEN w YIELD `the drinks allowance for the month` (`a checked month` TRUE TRUE 1 w 201310) GREATER THAN 0) (range 1 12)) EQUALS 10

-- F-2013-14_tashad_05-a over the calendar months: a month carries the new
-- rate and is not reimbursed at it exactly from 3/2013 to 8/2013.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD
                (isJust (`the drinks rate` c) AND NOT `the Ministry reimburses the month at the new rate` c)
                EQUALS (c AT LEAST `March 2013` AND c LESS THAN `September 2013`))
            `months checked`
